</Output>
</Group>
<Group labelreference="L312" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">
Now that we know the Killing vectors, let's return to the classification task. In our feature space, the separating hyperplane will be:
