<Input><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal">
Then, we wish to use the feature map to write this in the original (x,y) coordinates.
</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group hide-input="false" hide-output="false" labelreference="L297" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
